 "transcript": [
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung speaks to his sons, asking about their duties.",
  "[action] The eldest son and the second son bow in reply to their father.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and what is it you are about, then?\"",
  "[silence] Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "the eldest son: \"Well, and what is it you are about, then?\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung turns and goes back to the fields.",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son asks his father about the grain market.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and what is it you are about?\"",
  "[action] (to the second son) The eldest son and the second son bow in reply to their father.",
  "the second son (to the eldest son): \"It is only that I am beginning to trade,\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"It is not a great trade, but it is only in the beginning.\"",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung asks his son about the grain price.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and how much is it that you are selling grain for?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and what is it that you are selling grain for?\"",
  "the second son: \"There is not a grain in the world as good as this and no grain so fine as our rice, and it is better than any other grain in the land.\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and you have no better price than the other men of the town, and your rice is as good as any other men's.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and it is a good thing you have thought of it,\"",
  "[action] The eldest son and the second son bow again.",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) Eldest son and second son leave the field.",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) Eldest son praises his father's wealth."
